caption: Description
tradition-component: description

Gaoshou turns a complete mundane martial art into a supernatural discipline built from practiced technique, internal development, personal codes, and embodied mastery. Styles may be unarmed, armed, or mixed. Each Style is an institutional instance: learning a school gives its fixed Style, while Class access may create one original legal Style.
